  "prefLabel": "Rev 2501.15 Taxpayer identification number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2501.15 “Taxpayer identification number” means:\n\n(a) Social Security number;\n\n(b) Federal employer identification number;\n\n(c) Individual taxpayer identification number;\n\n(d) Preparer tax identification number; or\n\n(e) Department identification number.\n\nSource. #8495, eff 11-30-05 (formerly Rev 2501.15); ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13; ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (formerly Rev 2501.16) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
